      "content": "TL 10 NW                    REDBOURN             HOGG END LANE                                                  (south side) 9/222                                            Small barn 4 metres SW of                                                  Butlers farmhouse GV                                               II Small barn, built as animal shed in late C17 or early C18. Timber frame.  Weatherboarded.  Painted brick base.  Plain tile roof.  S side has slatted ventilator on left side, and similar ventilator over stable door towards right. Interior 3 bays.  Clasped purlin roof.  Long diagonal braces.  Floor added in C19. Listing NGR: TL1120408717"
